{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "6ca68b16ae01705b86439f4cf00794bc601cf04ecd0ee2e97cbd5ceafed93d65", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄的工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_8000_place", "source_sha256": "9832cc692497887513f6f9ba332386f15657a15fcfd31601a5526a4883e22921", "ja": "講堂", "zh": "礼堂", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_8001_p", "source_sha256": "9f6d55fa1fe213786f7a703f65cf92f507a313c854e6f88c524f3a27049174d0", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア企画で、\n瑞希のテーマは『警察のカラーガード隊』だ）", "zh": "（在偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真企划中，瑞希的主题是“警察仪仗队”）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_8002_044miz", "source_sha256": "ea416e13245a23a9c71a0d6498354d0ed10342f2266f89f3d7889dd544be6e33", "ja": "警察音楽隊の演奏に合わせ、フラッグなどを使ったり\nして演技するカラーガード隊。華やかで素敵です。", "zh": "配合警察乐队的演奏，使用旗帜等道具进行表演的彩旗队。既华丽又精彩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_8003_p", "source_sha256": "4318f0d1c02d0b90725c925ebbe4dfc59a71b8b9fc49275f360755824bfb5a0a", "ja": "そうだな。瑞希は学校のバトン部にも所属してるし、\nそこでの経験が活かせるかもしれないな。", "zh": "是啊。瑞希还参加了学校的棒球队，说不定能把那里的经验派上用场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_8004_044miz", "source_sha256": "ef79b1d209010ca175be381f3f8daece400fca8878bba9b3e2bc356be954880e", "ja": "はい。ここはひとつ、バトン部の名に恥じない\nカッコいいパフォーマンスを披露したいところ。", "zh": "是的。这里就拿出不负接力棒社之名的帅气表演吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_8005_044miz", "source_sha256": "432c8851502813ffd0a323bef558c56073df69058a08278103988d7ac1506eaa", "ja": "{$P$}、\nどんな振り付けがいいと思いますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，您觉得什么样的舞蹈动作比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_8006", "source_sha256": "a2d26e9b79a19ca493adbba8a77e824cbce3962bb948f54e167e18c8a83bb6b7", "ja": "フラッグを回す", "zh": "挥动旗帜", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_8007", "source_sha256": "73ba40cc02264e5ccacb30b07c646e68d92af94fab00d34753d078ccc9f6a99f", "ja": "フラッグを投げる", "zh": "投掷旗帜", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_8008", "source_sha256": "7a8ecf34617b66bcecba3a7cb023ef6f7ff61662bd59f547a095729854d0a3bb", "ja": "フラッグを置く", "zh": "放置旗帜", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_8100_p", "source_sha256": "af3ff818f2a0cd431f353d04ea145863efb8bf927d597a63bf599f62071345e5", "ja": "フラッグをぐるぐる回してみるとか？\nカラーガード隊らしい写真になると思うんだ。", "zh": "要不要试试把旗子转起来？\n这样拍出来的照片应该会很有彩旗队的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_8101_044miz", "source_sha256": "e0302421e4d6000b716112829e2f04840399f0affc561807e082ea1634f17bed", "ja": "そうですね。バトントワリングと同じように\nフラッグもぐるぐる回せるように練習してみます。", "zh": "好的。我要练习如何像花式棍操一样，让旗子也能转起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_8102_044miz", "source_sha256": "1aa2a6d0e592bce135fb9dd11de51d1a8cceb599e81e05a788dfdc43e7df2cb2", "ja": "{$P$}、もし上手くできたら、\nぜひ褒めてください。……おねだり。", "zh": "{$P$}，如果我能顺利做到，请一定要夸夸我。……这是请求。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_8200_p", "source_sha256": "51ac914a518e814846f66e32a647fa11f6892eb2dc50560a86202e7b368d174c", "ja": "フラッグを投げてみるのはどうだ？\n迫力のある写真が撮れるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "要不要试着把旗子扔出去？\n说不定能拍出很有气势的照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_8201_044miz", "source_sha256": "d7db6d6726bc10f9590204232878226ca10d03b9d467bf247dba12ffcd124baa", "ja": "難易度の高い振り付けですね。失敗しないか\n不安もありますが、チャレンジしてみたいです。", "zh": "这是难度很高的舞蹈动作呢。虽然有些担心会不会失败，但我想挑战一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_8202_044miz", "source_sha256": "fc59e30dbd880e4ef68eba63145fd844bedfdc5a68f9fc26af96af8b32c23359", "ja": "そうと決まれば、早速練習しないと……。\n{$P$}、見守っていてください。", "zh": "既然决定了，就得赶紧开始练习……  \n{$P$}，请注视着我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_8300_p", "source_sha256": "79007bc4686c3a8e8765cd1e1bc341ed6de82628c90b4d9613a67bcc7ab981ae", "ja": "派手なダンスを見せる必要はないんじゃないかな。\nそっとフラッグを置くだけでもカッコいいと思うよ。", "zh": "我觉得没必要跳华丽的舞蹈。\n只是轻轻放下旗子，也会很帅气哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_8301_044miz", "source_sha256": "3c6685be5aa3b27f8d82ceab0988715c3d29617fa5b90fe55ab59e4d269ef1f3", "ja": "なるほど……。置くという発想はありませんでした。\nフラッグを振ったりしてみたかったのですが……。", "zh": "原来如此……我没想到还可以放下旗子。\n我本来想试着挥挥旗子的……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_8302_044miz", "source_sha256": "598f4757d095fe14dd6208efd3201a07dffbe6579f99652160ae1cab30d20f80", "ja": "本当に大丈夫でしょうか？　{$P$}が\nそう言うなら……いえ、でも……。", "zh": "真的没问题吗？　既然{$P$}这么说……不，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
